00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:37.580
Mathematics 1

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:37.500
Argh! I don't even know
what I thought I knew!

00:13:38.260 --> 00:13:43.590
Argh! This is the worst! Total panic!

00:13:46.430 --> 00:13:48.270
Hmm?

00:13:48.270 --> 00:13:54.860
What's that dent? This is my room,
but I don't think that's mine.

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:59.030
You have an announcement?

00:13:59.030 --> 00:14:03.820
Not really an announcement.
I've just got something to say.

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:07.990
Yeah, I heard you're taking up polo again.

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:15.290
About that... I'm not. It's too much.
Sorry for getting your hopes up.

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:19.960
Junior high Minato was
something else. I can't do that.

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:22.380
It's fine. Don't push yourself.

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:23.840
Really?!

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:26.390
Your happiness matters most.

00:14:26.390 --> 00:14:31.230
Mm-hmm. Just eating
together again is plenty.

00:14:31.230 --> 00:14:38.730
Whew! That's a relief! I thought maybe
you guys were hoping I'd play again.

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:41.530
Nope. Not really.

00:14:41.530 --> 00:14:46.490
Jeez! All that worry for nothing! Man!

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:55.490
Actually--!

00:14:55.490 --> 00:14:57.960
You better start studying!

00:14:57.960 --> 00:14:59.040
Huh?

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:02.630
You're three years behind
and were dumb to start.

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:06.970
Shuddap! I know I'm an idiot
so I can't be that dumb.

00:15:06.970 --> 00:15:09.140
You're deluding yourself.

00:15:09.140 --> 00:15:12.770
Shuddap! It takes an idiot to know one!

00:15:12.770 --> 00:15:19.650
That's your argument? Even if that's true,
you've conceded you're an idiot.

00:15:13.980 --> 00:15:19.650
She's really matured--
changing the subject to fix the mood.

00:15:19.650 --> 00:15:23.570
Before, she was just a blabbermouth.

00:15:19.650 --> 00:15:20.810
Get with it.

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:21.820
Fine.

00:15:21.820 --> 00:15:23.570
This isn't over.

00:15:23.570 --> 00:15:25.490
Forget it!

00:15:56.810 --> 00:15:58.440
No!

00:16:02.650 --> 00:16:04.280
Asumi?

00:16:06.240 --> 00:16:08.660
It's okay. It's okay.

00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:14.950
It's all right.

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:20.210
I know you're scared.
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:37.850
"Remain: One type of rule violation.
Refers to receiving the ball within
two meters of the opponent's goal."

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:35.970
I see...

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:38.690
Ever since 6th grade...

00:16:38.690 --> 00:16:45.650
My family's been stuck on the day
of the accident... and remained there.

00:16:57.540 --> 00:16:59.580
All right!

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:05.130
I've got loads of free time to
get stuff done, so let's study!

00:17:05.130 --> 00:17:07.050
Hardcore rehab!

00:17:07.050 --> 00:17:11.050
Study! Study! Study!

00:17:11.050 --> 00:17:14.890
Rehab! Study! Rehab!

00:17:14.890 --> 00:17:16.390
Manga...

00:17:16.390 --> 00:17:20.940
Study! Rehab! Study! Rehab!

00:17:20.940 --> 00:17:23.690
Manga... Manga...

00:17:23.690 --> 00:17:25.940
Study! And more manga!

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:32.160
That's how I spent a good eight months.
And that following spring...

00:17:32.160 --> 00:17:38.660
I miraculously got into a combined
junior/high school of 1,000 students--

00:17:38.660 --> 00:17:44.250
the prestigious Rikka Gakuen,
an academic and sports powerhouse!

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:44.160
Rikka Gakuen 
Senior High

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:51.970
Of course not. But I did enter Yamanami
High School, which was right next to it.

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:52.050
"Okayama Prefecture
Yamanami High School"

00:17:52.720 --> 00:17:55.970
"69th Entrance Ceremony"

00:18:01.980 --> 00:18:03.600
That's strange.

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:05.980
Can we be done?!

00:18:07.650 --> 00:18:14.410
All right! It's time to enjoy
my new school life!

00:18:14.410 --> 00:18:16.490
Minato-<i>senpai</i>!

00:18:16.490 --> 00:18:21.120
Minato-<i>senpai</i>! It's great
to be at school with you!

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:23.040
Why are you here?!

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:27.000
I asked Asumi about your plans and got in!

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:29.000
Why go that far?!

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:32.760
You picked here to play water polo, right?

00:18:32.760 --> 00:18:33.880
Huh?

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:36.260
They've got a club here!

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:42.390
No, no, no! I entered 'cuz of my grades
and it was close to home! That's it!

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:45.520
Liar! It's to play water polo!

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:49.150
I said, "No"! I'm done with water polo!

00:18:49.150 --> 00:18:51.820
Huh? Senpai!

00:18:54.110 --> 00:18:56.160
Wanna play baseball?!

00:18:56.160 --> 00:18:58.240
Sorry, I'm busy!

00:18:58.240 --> 00:18:59.990
How about ping-pong?!

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:01.660
Can't right now!

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:03.660
Do you like basketball?!

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:06.130
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:16.180
Uh, where's my seat?

00:19:16.180 --> 00:19:17.760
Here, huh?

00:19:20.890 --> 00:19:23.600
Your attention, please!

00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:25.190
'Sup?!

00:19:27.350 --> 00:19:30.940
I'm the water polo captain, Jo Jojima!

00:19:30.940 --> 00:19:36.820
From the top, it's Jojima Jo!
From the bottom, it's Jo Jimajo!

00:19:30.980 --> 00:19:36.020
Water Polo Captain
Jo Jojima

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:38.120
See?!

00:19:38.120 --> 00:19:41.160
How do you follow that?

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:48.170
If you wanna play water polo with a kind
and honest captain, put your hand up!

00:19:41.240 --> 00:19:48.250
"1) You'll be popular!" "2) Good stress relief!"
"3) Sleep like a log!" "4) It's fun!"

00:19:52.210 --> 00:19:58.220
What party poopers! Let's get a few of you
to join for the heck of it! Say, "Me!"

00:19:58.220 --> 00:20:01.470
Who joins for the heck of it?

00:20:01.470 --> 00:20:04.810
Besides, water polo is such a minor sport.

00:20:04.810 --> 00:20:05.770
Sure is.

00:20:05.770 --> 00:20:07.140
Yeah.

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:11.360
What a sad bunch.

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:18.240
Don't choose a club 'cuz they're big
or not. Join 'cuz you want to.

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:22.830
Whatever.

00:20:27.370 --> 00:20:28.670
Huh?

00:20:46.230 --> 00:20:50.150
That was close!
I thought he locked on to me!

00:20:54.530 --> 00:20:57.150
I'd be popular playing soccer.

00:20:57.150 --> 00:21:02.450
Then again, I might grow taller
and be more popular in basketball.

00:21:02.450 --> 00:21:04.910
Join water polo, dude!

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:09.670
You're Minato Kiyomizu, right?
How cool that you came here!

00:21:09.670 --> 00:21:12.840
Sorry, I'm Taro Tanaka.

00:21:12.840 --> 00:21:15.500
Ditch the ugly face and name!

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:18.380
That's rude to all the Taro Tanakas!

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:21.640
Quit lying! You're Minato!
I saw you in a magazi--!

00:21:21.640 --> 00:21:23.640
Nope! Wrong person!

00:21:23.640 --> 00:21:26.770
Huh? Please! Join water polo!

00:21:26.770 --> 00:21:28.520
You're mistaken!

00:21:28.520 --> 00:21:31.850
It's true! He's Minato Kiyomizu!

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:32.940
Ambush!

00:21:32.940 --> 00:21:37.400
Senpai! Let's join together!
It's the whole reason I came here!

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:39.900
And why should I care?!

00:21:45.700 --> 00:21:47.950
You wanna join, too?

00:21:47.950 --> 00:21:50.330
Yup! That's right!

00:21:51.460 --> 00:21:52.830
Sweet!

00:21:54.210 --> 00:21:56.460
What's wrong with these guys?!

00:22:12.270 --> 00:22:14.610
Good! I think I'm safe.

00:22:14.610 --> 00:22:16.900
Wait up!

00:22:16.900 --> 00:22:18.650
Come back!

00:22:17.940 --> 00:22:19.570
So persistent!

00:22:20.570 --> 00:22:24.490
Huh? I think I know this place.

00:22:24.490 --> 00:22:27.740
Wasn't there a thicket back here?

00:22:30.580 --> 00:22:32.790
C'mon! Join water polo!

00:22:32.790 --> 00:22:35.250
Senpai!

00:22:38.550 --> 00:22:40.170
It's been a while.

00:22:40.170 --> 00:22:41.510
Huh?

00:22:45.260 --> 00:22:46.850
What?!

00:22:46.850 --> 00:22:50.890
Uh, isn't this girl...?

00:22:50.890 --> 00:22:54.060
You seem better than I thought.

00:22:54.060 --> 00:22:56.860
Huh? Um...

00:22:56.860 --> 00:22:58.190
What?

00:23:05.030 --> 00:23:08.620
Huh?! What's going on?!
